SCYTHE>  equal to its nutritional value/50. That way a dragon will
SCYTHE>  give you more tins than a newt.  But to keep people from
SCYTHE>  easily getting intrinsics, monsters should only have one
SCYTHE>  tin's worth of power.  Perhaps only the heart of the dragon
