Another good idea! The tin descriptions that we already have
("pureed," "deep-fried," etc.) could be changed to "filet of...," "eye
of...," "heart of...," and only the proper tin would grant intrinsics.
This would be a new thing for players to have to figure out and could
wind up as part of a FAQ.

